<h3>Ball Count</h3>

<p>
Enter the counts registered by each detector.  The units of the resonse is up
to you (i.e. counts per sec, counts per min., or counts per 5 mins).  Use the 
same time units for each detector.  Be sure to correct for dead time of the 
detector.
</p>

<p>
You must also check "Detectors Used to Unfold" to actually use this data.
</p>
